    level: "A2",
    theme: "Volksfest und Kirmes: Riesenrad, Zuckerwatte und die Losbude",
    description: "Funfair German — the big wheel above the town, ramming on purpose in the bumper cars, plastic roses from the shooting gallery, candied almonds, and dancing on benches in the tent.",
